SevenZipKit — 7-Zip licence and attribution

The static library in this directory is a build of 7-Zip, linked into
MacRAR. It carries 7-Zip's archive formats, codecs and the extract and
update logic of its 7zz command-line program, behind a C interface added
by the fork it is built from.

